<title>USA: Noble to shut natgas plant for 8-10 days.</title>
<headline>Noble to shut natgas plant for 8-10 days.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Noble Affiliates Inc said it plans to shut its Venice natural gas plant in Louisiana for eight to 10 days during August for maintenance.</p>
<p>It added that the Venice gas gathering system may also be shut during the plant maintenance period.</p>
<p>The gathering system transports about 500 million cubic feet of gas per day, of which about 46 million cubic feet comes from properties in which Noble owns an interest, the company said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Energy Desk 212 859 1633))</p>
